              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute in the attribute list, followed by an equals sign ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "), and then the resource ID of the target page. How many of the target page’s "
              },
